## Local Overrides

Add org- or project-specific retrieval rules here. Helix sync preserves content outside managed sections.

## CLI Workflow

This meta repo is primarily operated from **Copilot CLI**. Read `helix/docs/cli-workflow.md` for the phase-by-phase CLI playbook before routing work or guiding a user through phases.

Key rules for CLI operation:
- Interactive phases (JAM, PRD, TECH DESIGN, SETUP) must run at the top-level host agent — sub-agents cannot use `ask_user`
- Autonomous phases (DECOMPOSER, IMPLEMENTER, REVIEWER, SCRIBE, DISTILLER) dispatch as background sub-agents
- `@helix` orchestrator is only worth invoking in CLI for the IMPLEMENTATION ralph loop
- Workspace artifact files are the handoff between phases — always pass explicit artifact paths when routing
